              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eScan a LOT into Trim on \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCheck IN\u003c/span\u003e, then scan or tap it back out on \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eTrim OUT\u003c/span\u003e once it is ready to move on.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck a LOT in\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eIf this press is shared, pick it from \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eScan or pick a press\u003c/span\u003e at the top first. Then scan the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eScan LTT\u003c/span\u003e - the LOT, item, and eligibility show up for you to check. Press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eMove\u003c/span\u003e to commit it to this cell.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eIt\u0027s in Trim now\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe LOT shows up under \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCurrently in Trim\u003c/span\u003e for this press. It stays there - no further action needed - until you check it out.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eSelect the LOT on Trim OUT\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eSwitch to \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eTrim OUT\u003c/span\u003e. Tap the LOT\u0027s card in the Trim inventory list, or scan its \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLTT Barcode\u003c/span\u003e, then enter the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLot count\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eAdd scrap, then check it out\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eTap a reason under \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eScrap reasons\u003c/span\u003e to add one piece; press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eMore reasons\u003c/span\u003e if the reason you need is not on the short list. Press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eTrim OUT\u003c/span\u003e to release the whole LOT out of Trim.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eTrim OUT always moves the entire LOT together - there is no split here.\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
